3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:07,750
That's just right

4
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,750
Which one comes first?

5
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:12,330
Why can he still turn?

6
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:15,790
Chief Wen

7
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:17,790
