12
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:32,540
Call again later

13
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:40,020
Chief Wen's swordsmanship comes in again

14
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,370
Chief Wen

15
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:43,560
Please give me some advice

16
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:47,290
Where is my sword?

17
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:48,610
Thank you, Chief Wen
